SUMMARY:Mexican Day Toronto 2026!
DESCRIPTION:Language Exchange Toronto - Se Habla English & Spanish\n¡Hola
 \, language lovers! 🇲🇽✨\nAre you ready to practice your Spanish an
 d English in the most authentic\, vibrant setting possible? Join us for an
  unforgettable group outing as **Se Habla Language Exchange** heads to **M
 exican Day Toronto 2026**!\n\nWhether you want to test out your Spanish or
  English with native speakers\, soak in rich cultural traditions\, or just
  enjoy incredible food with fellow language learners\, this is the perfect
  chance to connect and immerse yourself.\n\n### 📍 Event Details\n\n* **
 Date:** Sunday\, September 13\, 2026\n* **Hours:** 1 PM\n* **Location:** N
 athan Phillips Square (100 Queen St W\, Toronto)\n* **Admission:** FREE!\n
 \n### 🌮 What’s in Store?\n\n* **Unbeatable Food:** Sample your way th
 rough 70+ Mexican food vendors—the ultimate vocabulary test for ordering
  your favorite tacos!\n* **Live Entertainment:** Enjoy live mariachi music
 \, traditional folkloric dance performances\, and vibrant cultural shows.\
 n* **Special Highlights:** Experience high-energy *Lucha Libre* (Mexican w
 restling) matches and the official reenactment of *El Grito* by Mexico's C
 onsul General.\n* **Culture & Community:** Family-friendly workshops\, art
 s\, crafts\, and plenty of opportunities to chat in Spanish and English wi
 th our community.\n\nStay tuned for our exact group meeting spot and time 
 at the square! In the meantime\, you can check out the official [Mexican T
 oronto Instagram Page](https://www.instagram.com/mexicantoronto/) for sche
 dule announcements and event updates.\nBring your appetite\, your enthusia
 sm\, and your best Spanish phrasebook.\n\nSee you there! 🎉🙌
